{"id":"nepremenno","lemma":"непременно","pos":"adv","rank":2092,"glosses":["without fail, certainly"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/1a/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B5%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%BC%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B5%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%BC%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Вы непременно должны прийти.","en":"You must come without fail.","words":[{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},null,null,{"g":"to come , to arrive"}]},{"text":"Я позвоню вам непременно.","en":"I will call you without fail.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to call","l":"позвонить"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"вы"},null]},{"text":"Я непременно завтра приду.","en":"I'll come tomorrow without fail.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"tomorrow"},{"g":"to come , to arrive","l":"прийти"}]},{"text":"Я непременно это сделаю.","en":"I'll do that without fail.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"to make, to do","l":"сделать"}]},{"text":"Тому непременно надо это сделать.","en":"Tom is bound to do that.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},null,{"g":"must, necessary"},{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"to make, to do"}]}]}